@model MOROPO.CITMA.CMG.iCITMA.Models.View.PersonDisplayViewModel


<!-- Modal -->
<div class="modal fade " id="descrip-@Model.Id" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Detalles</h5>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.Name)</h5>
                            <p>@Model.Name</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-5">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.LastName)</h5>
                            <p>@Model.LastName</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.Sex)</h5>
                            <p>@Html.DisplayName(GlobalViewLocalizationHelper.Localize(Model.Sex.ToString(), ViewLocalizer))</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.TeachingCategoryName)</h5>
                            <p>@Model.TeachingCategoryName</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.ResearcherCategoryName)</h5>
                            <p>@Model.ResearcherCategoryName</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <h5>@Html.DisplayNameFor(model => model.About)</h5>
                            <p style="word-wrap: break-word;">@Model.About</p>
                        </div>                        
                    </div>                    
                </div>
            </div>            
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
